Skip the tooltip delay while another tooltip is showing

Every tooltip waits out the show delay, including when the pointer
moves from one control to the next while reading tooltips, so sweeping
a toolbar shows each one only after a pause. Show a tooltip at once
while the window shows another, and for a short time after the last
one hid in any window.

